/* App Shortcut phrases.

   This file is not here for translation — Loom ships English only. It is here because its presence
   is what makes Xcode run the AppIntentsSSUTraining build phase (appintentsnltrainingprocessor),
   which is what trains Siri's spoken-phrase model from the templates in LoomShortcuts. Without it,
   `LM_STRINGS_FILE_PATH_LIST` is empty, the phase is skipped, no root.ssu.yaml is produced, and
   Siri answers "I can't do that in the Loom app" for every phrase — even though the actions are
   correctly exported in Metadata.appintents and work fine in the Shortcuts app.

   Keys must match the phrases in LoomShortcuts.appShortcuts exactly. */

"Run ${project} in ${applicationName}" = "Run ${project} in ${applicationName}";
"Run ${project} with input in ${applicationName}" = "Run ${project} with input in ${applicationName}";
"Run ${query} in ${applicationName}" = "Run ${query} in ${applicationName}";
"Search ${applicationName} logs" = "Search ${applicationName} logs";
